    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb8e87c276f60b5e624a15b4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错，目白家的赛马娘正是每个人的“憧憬”。\n每个人心中的──光之子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "803a27ba8591ffbce471fcfb368c513b5233c528486bdd951403d4046695790c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
